  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "It seems like a thousand years ago...",
      "start": 1.001,
      "end": 7.015
    },
    {
      "text": "I fought my way out of that cave...",
      "start": 7.716,
      "end": 9.475000000000001
    },
    {
      "text": "Became Iron Man...",
      "start": 10.427,
      "end": 11.811
    },
    {
      "text": "Realized I loved you...",
      "start": 14.889,
      "end": 16.316
    },
    {
      "text": "I know I said no more surprises, but...",
      "start": 20.562,
      "end": 22.772
    },
    {
      "text": "I was really hoping to pull off one last one.",
      "start": 22.772,
      "end": 26.534
    },
    {
      "text": "The world has changed.",
      "start": 29.195,
      "end": 31.331
    },
    {
      "text": "None of us can go back...",
      "start": 33.491,
      "end": 35.834999999999994
    },
    {
      "text": "All we can do is our best...",
      "start": 40.04,
      "end": 41.965999999999994
    },
    {
      "text": "And sometimes the best that we can do...",
      "start": 42.834,
      "end": 45.47
    },
    {
      "text": "Is to start over.",
      "start": 46.921,
      "end": 48.598
    },
    {
      "text": "I saw all these people die.",
      "start": 60.727,
      "end": 63.028999999999996
    },
    {
      "text": "I keep telling everybody they should move on...",
      "start": 66.9,
      "end": 69.327
    },
    {
      "text": "Some do...",
      "start": 71.446,
      "end": 72.789
    },
    {
      "text": "But not us.",
      "start": 73.156,
      "end": 74.665
    },
    {
      "text": "Even if there's a...",
      "start": 77.869,
      "end": 79.037
    },
    {
      "text": "Small chance...",
      "start": 79.037,
      "end": 80.33800000000001
    },
    {
      "text": "We owe this...",
      "start": 81.206,
      "end": 82.548
    },
    {
      "text": "To everyone who's not in this room to",
      "start": 83.958,
      "end": 86.844
    },
    {
      "text": "We will.",
      "start": 90.673,
      "end": 92.18299999999999
    },
    {
      "text": "Whatever it takes.",
      "start": 93.802,
      "end": 95.269
    },
    {
      "text": "Whatever it takes.",
      "start": 98.64,
      "end": 99.857
    },
    {
      "text": "Whatever it takes.",
      "start": 101.768,
      "end": 103.111
    },
    {
      "text": "Whatever it takes.",
      "start": 109.234,
      "end": 110.576
    },
    {
      "text": "I like this one.",
      "start": 139.722,
      "end": 140.98200000000003
    }
